# The service's tests in the development VM (README.md, Tests): the same packages as
# requirements-gpu.in with ONNX Runtime's CPU build, plus pytest and requests (the
# warehouse's HTTP client) for the tests. Not for grace. The lock file requirements-cpu.txt
# (with hashes, for x86_64) is made from this one:
#   uv pip compile --no-build --generate-hashes --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_34 \
#     --python-version 3.12 requirements-cpu.in -o requirements-cpu.txt
